  "_note": "A charge on the buy side of a disposal is part of the cost of acquisition, deducted from the full value of the consideration: TY 2025-26 Income-tax Act, 1961 s.48(ii) (subs. by the Finance Act, 1992 s.24, w.e.f. 1-4-1993); TY 2026-27 Income-tax Act, 2025 s.72(1)(b). Which charges on a contract note are cost or transfer expenditure the Acts do not say; the codes are the charge catalogue's, classified by the owner's ruling D-375 C2a.",
